    "summary": "Knife and sheath, the knife with single-edged iron blade and bone handle bound with strips of leather, the sheath of carved reindeer bone with leather grip. The sheath formed of two pieces of bone hollowed and incised with a reindeer and geometric ornamnet on one side, and a reindeer only on the other, the two pieces held together with two iron pegs at the curved end and by the leather grip. The grip formed of one piece of leather with integral loop for the leather thong.",
